{
  "name": "round6_pretrained_cv",
  "description": "Five-fold run of ConvNeXt-Tiny initialised from the authors' ImageNet-1k weights (round5 recipe: 40 epochs, peak LR 5e-5, strong augmentation, three-slice context, final-epoch weights, seed 3710). Same folds and pipeline as the scratch ConvNeXt and the CNN of round3_cv_final_epoch. Folds 4 and 5 repeat round5 with identical settings.",
